- webhook secret 확인

```text
terraform output -json | jq -r '.argocd_webhook_secret.value'
```

- ingress 등록 확인
```sh
CTX=arn:aws:eks:ap-northeast-2:699016088228:cluster/preppers-cluster
kubectl get ingress argocd-ui-alb -n argocd --context=$CTX
```
- http 호출 확인
```sh
curl -sk -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\n' -H 'Host: prod-gbx-argocd.supp.fitness' https://internal-eks-prod-argocd-ui-536345078.ap-northeast-2.elb.amazonaws.com/
```